        "Couldn't save {label}" to "{label} save nahi ho paya",
        "VoxelPort hosting stays free for everyone: the app, the free address (like play.voxelport.in:26137) and the public server list. A custom name like yourname.voxelport.in is a supporter perk. If you want to chip in, supporters also get a few extras as a thank-you." to "VoxelPort hosting sabke liye free rehti hai: app, free address (jaise play.voxelport.in:26137) aur public server list. yourname.voxelport.in jaisa custom naam ek supporter perk hai. Agar madad karna chaho, to supporters ko shukriya ke taur par kuch extras bhi milte hain.",
        "★ Supporter badge on the server list, and your server pinned to the top" to "★ Server list mein Supporter badge, aur tumhara server sabse upar pin",
        "A custom address like yourname.voxelport.in, so Java players skip the port number (new custom names are for supporters, and yours never expires from disuse)" to "yourname.voxelport.in jaisa custom address, taaki Java players ko port number na lagana pade (naye custom naam supporters ke liye hain, aur tumhara use na hone se kabhi expire nahi hota)",
        "Everything in Supporter" to "Supporter ke saare perks",
        "A short address of 1–2 characters, like vp.voxelport.in (first come, first served; you pick it)" to "1–2 characters ka chhota address, jaise vp.voxelport.in (jo pehle aaye use pehle milta hai; naam tum chunte ho)",
        "Automatic voice chat on Paper and Fabric servers: once your rank is on, the app installs and sets up Simple Voice Chat for you and friends just join with your server address (they need the matching voice mod)" to "Paper aur Fabric servers par automatic voice chat: rank on hote hi app tumhare liye Simple Voice Chat install aur set up kar deta hai, aur dost bas tumhare server address se join karte hain (unhe matching voice mod chahiye)",
        "Tip any amount (₹99 or more for Supporter, ₹299 or more for Supporter+) by UPI, then email traz@voxelport.in with your UPI reference number, your server's address (like mysmp.voxelport.in) and, for Supporter+, your VoxelPort ID (copy it from the app's server settings). It's switched on by hand, usually within a day or two." to "Koi bhi rakam UPI se tip do (Supporter ke liye ₹99 ya zyada, Supporter+ ke liye ₹299 ya zyada), phir traz@voxelport.in par apna UPI reference number, apne server ka address (jaise mysmp.voxelport.in) aur, Supporter+ ke liye, apna VoxelPort ID (app ki server settings se copy karo) email karo. Yeh haath se on kiya jata hai, aam taur par ek-do din mein.",
        "Perks are a thank-you for a donation, not a purchase, and last as long as VoxelPort runs. If one is ever misused it can be taken back." to "Perks donation ke liye shukriya hain, khareed nahi, aur jab tak VoxelPort chalta hai tab tak rehte hain. Agar kabhi inka galat use hua to wapas liye ja sakte hain.",
        "Some of these are affiliate links: VoxelPort may earn a commission if you sign up, at no extra cost to you. VoxelPort itself stays free either way." to "Inme se kuch affiliate links hain: agar tum sign up karte ho to VoxelPort ko commission mil sakta hai, tumhe koi extra kharcha nahi. VoxelPort khud dono tarah free rehta hai.",
        "No UPI app found, so the UPI ID {id} was copied. Paste it into any payment app, or use GitHub Sponsors." to "Koi UPI app nahi mila, isliye UPI ID {id} copy kar li gayi. Ise kisi bhi payment app mein paste karo, ya GitHub Sponsors use karo.",
        "TIP ANOTHER AMOUNT" to "DOOSRI RAKAM KA TIP DO",
        "♥ SUPPORT VOXELPORT" to "♥ VOXELPORT KO SUPPORT KARO",
        "Free for everyone, no ads. If it helped, a small tip keeps the relay online. Tap an amount to pay with your UPI app." to "Sabke liye free, koi ads nahi. Agar isse madad mili, to ek chhota tip relay ko online rakhta hai. Apne UPI app se pay karne ke liye koi rakam dabao.",
        "Supporter perks and more ›" to "Supporter perks aur aur jaano ›",
        "VoxelPort has no ads and no paid plan. The relay runs on a server I pay for myself. Any amount helps, even ₹20." to "VoxelPort mein koi ads ya paid plan nahi hai. Relay ek aise server par chalta hai jiska kharcha main khud deta hoon. Koi bhi rakam madad karti hai, ₹20 bhi.",
