        // Address backup to the Discord account
        "Back up your address to your Discord account, so you can get it back on a new phone or PC." to "Apna address apne Discord account mein backup karo, taaki naye phone ya PC par wapas mil sake.",
        "Your Discord account has a backed-up address (ending {id}) that is not the one on this phone. Restore it to use that address here." to "Tumhare Discord account mein ek backup address hai (aakhir mein {id}) jo is phone wala nahi hai. Wo address yahan use karne ke liye restore karo.",
        "Your address is backed up to your Discord account." to "Tumhara address tumhare Discord account mein backup hai.",
        "BACK UP MY ADDRESS" to "MERA ADDRESS BACKUP KARO",
        "RESTORE MY ADDRESS" to "MERA ADDRESS RESTORE KARO",
        "Delete backup" to "Backup delete karo",
