        "Restore your address" to "Apna address restore karo",
        "Delete the backup?" to "Backup delete karna hai?",
        "The locked copy is removed from your Discord account. Your address on this phone is not changed." to "Locked copy tumhare Discord account se hat jayegi. Is phone ka address nahi badlega.",
        "Back up" to "Backup karo",
        "Choose a passphrase of at least 12 characters. Only you know it: VoxelPort can't recover it, and without it the backup can't be opened." to "Kam se kam 12 characters ka passphrase chuno. Ye sirf tumhe pata hai: VoxelPort ise recover nahi kar sakta, aur iske bina backup khul nahi sakta.",
        "Type the passphrase you chose when you backed up your address. This phone will then use that address, and the one it has now is left behind." to "Wo passphrase likho jo tumne address backup karte waqt chuna tha. Phir ye phone wahi address use karega, aur abhi wala peeche reh jayega.",
