        "Couldn't make a secure connection to {host}. A VPN, ad-blocker or Private DNS on this phone, a Wi-Fi filter or a wrong date can cause this. Try another network." to "{host} se secure connection nahi ban paya. Is phone par VPN, ad-blocker ya Private DNS, Wi-Fi filter ya galat date iski wajah ho sakti hai. Dusra network try karo.",
        "The server is ready, but Bedrock support couldn't be added: {detail} Java players can still join. Open Setup and install again to retry." to "Server taiyaar hai, lekin Bedrock support add nahi ho paya: {detail} Java players phir bhi join kar sakte hain. Dobara try karne ke liye Setup kholo aur dobara install karo.",
        // Delete server
