        "This permanently deletes this server's world, plugins and settings from your phone. Your backups, your address and your Discord sign-in are kept. This can't be undone." to "Ye is server ki world, plugins aur settings tumhare phone se hamesha ke liye hata dega. Tumhare backups, address aur Discord sign-in bache rahenge. Isse wapas nahi liya ja sakta.",
        "You have no backups of this world yet. Make one first if you want to keep it." to "Is world ka abhi koi backup nahi hai. Rakhna ho to pehle backup bana lo.",
