        // Android build 20: play flow, phone check, players, address test, fixes
        "Your address works. Friends can join. ({ms} ms, {players}/{max} players)" to "Tumhara address chal raha hai. Dost join kar sakte hain. ({ms} ms, {players}/{max} players)",
        "This phone can't find the VoxelPort relay. Check your internet, and turn off any VPN, ad-blocker or Private DNS, then test again." to "Ye phone VoxelPort relay dhoondh nahi pa raha. Apna internet check karo, VPN, ad-blocker ya Private DNS band karo, phir dobara test karo.",
        "The test timed out. The connection may be slow, or something on this network is blocking it. Try another network, then test again." to "Test ka time khatam ho gaya. Connection slow ho sakta hai, ya is network par kuch ise rok raha hai. Dusra network try karo, phir dobara test karo.",
        "The relay refused the connection. Make the server public again, then test again." to "Relay ne connection mana kar diya. Server ko dobara public karo, phir dobara test karo.",
        "The relay answered, but your server didn't. It may still be starting. Wait for Online, then test again." to "Relay ne jawab diya, lekin tumhare server ne nahi. Shayad abhi start ho raha hai. Online dikhne tak ruko, phir dobara test karo.",
        "Something answered, but it didn't look like a Minecraft server. Restart the server and test again." to "Kisi ne jawab diya, lekin wo Minecraft server jaisa nahi tha. Server restart karo aur dobara test karo.",
        "The server ran out of memory. A lighter setting fixes this." to "Server ki memory khatam ho gayi. Halki setting se ye theek ho jata hai.",
        "USE LIGHTER SETTINGS" to "HALKI SETTINGS LAGAO",
        "Another copy of the server is still using the port. Restarting clears it." to "Server ki ek aur copy abhi bhi port use kar rahi hai. Restart karne se ye hat jata hai.",
        "FIX AND RESTART" to "THEEK KARO AUR RESTART KARO",
        "The phone is out of storage, so the server can't save. Free some space (old backups are a good start)." to "Phone ki storage bhar gayi hai, isliye server save nahi kar pa raha. Thodi jagah khali karo (purane backups se shuru karo).",
